[sub_resource type="RoseDialogLine" id="RoseDialogLine_73f086"]
text = "Windy hills, farms and a big lake. The Woopies and Honeybees out there are tougher than the ones by Zant, and the Rackies rob our wagons further on. Go carefully, and come back to Zant to rest and trade."
